# Chocolate cake recipe

## Ingredients

- 3 eggs
- 200g dark chocolate
- 1 cup of sugar
- 1 cup of flour
- 80g butter

## Instructions

1. Beat the eggs until pale yellow, add sugar and beat until the preparation becomes clear and a bit foamy
2. Add the flour and mix.
3. In a separate container, put the chocolate and the butter, and melt it (microwave or "bain marie"). Note: careful not to overcook it!
4. When the butter+chocolate has cooled down a bit, add it to the rest of the preparation.


   
